This project incorporates work from the displaycameras-modern project:

    Copyright 2026 Miguel Costa
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

Specifically, the mpv JSON IPC client (common/mpvipc.py) is adapted from that
project's displaycameras-ipc helper, and the stream watchdog
(v3-server-pi-webui/pi/bin/videowall-watchdog.py) ports its self-heal detection
logic and thresholds — frozen and degraded streams identified by comparing
playback advance against wall-clock time, corrupt streams identified by decoder
drop-count bursts, the consecutive-strike rule that avoids reconnect thrashing,
and recovery by in-place reconnect rather than restarting the player.

displaycameras-modern is itself a modernized reimplementation of the
"displaycameras" project by Anonymousdog:

    https://github.com/Anonymousdog/displaycameras

which is also licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
